      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Geelong's post-war suburbs went up in the same decades asbestos cement was standard building material. If you've found sheeting you're not sure about, get it tested before you touch it.</p>
